{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-19_beg","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-19","title":"殷紅君主","storyCode":"13-21","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-19_beg.txt","sourceHash":"be22f5ea5d03443be8c6e82e4ee3fa276892363bbb9cb37c8648d1bec5b06303","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g4_spinestops_ex"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君先前留給薩卡茲的祝福仍未褪去，但剛才——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道博士他們說的是指……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g4_spinestops_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……赫德雷，W，別發呆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁現在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，你埋的那些炸藥呢？馬上引爆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不用你提醒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別猜來猜去了，赫德雷，管它是什麼，我們只應付自己能應付的對手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W的炸彈撕開了守衛的防線，突圍，我們被他們糾纏得太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭和Logos已經先我們一步了，他們會幫我們處理掉最麻煩的那個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於其他的……沿著他們開的路，從那些棧橋登上巨獸的骸骨！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，這些傢伙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別再讓他們繼續通過！厄爾蘇拉指揮官正在收起舷梯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓叛徒死在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些混蛋的屍體會送去食腐者之王閣下的營帳，供養我們接下來的勝利！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在骨頭下面埋雷，體驗感還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，伊內絲，準備好——衝擊波來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，三枚手雷，斜下方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好主意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我最後一次這麼配合你們的爆炸性胡鬧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g2_giantmonsterspine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走這邊，這具骸骨的中樞就在這個方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的目標是厄爾蘇拉，找到她，拿下我們腳下這東西的控制權。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倆確定這個骨架子真的可以被“拿下”？聽起來輕率得簡直就像是打劫商隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"必須能。否則阿米婭和Logos的戰鬥會毫無意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我們要拉開車門，把司機丟出去，拔下鑰匙——“好，現在這輛車歸我了”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你看過了這東西激起的幻象，在它的骨骼之間穿行，卻還什麼都沒有想到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不是什麼冷門故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我該想到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忘了，你對歷史故事不感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"數百年前，薩卡茲們曾殺死過一隻險些毀滅了某座卡茲戴爾的巨獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那隻巨獸隕落之後，有關它去向的說法多種多樣，其中有一條是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的意識並未消亡，而是被分解，封印進了數件物品之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在看來，這個說法恐怕確實是真相的一部分，至於那具失去了意識的空殼……在這場戰爭之前，都被某些人小心地收藏起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們花了很大功夫來改造它，而它確實在這場戰爭中，為軍事委員會派上了大用場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“數件物品”。厄爾蘇拉以前可沒有揣著一隻懷錶的習慣，疤痕商場裡就她從不守時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，如果她手上的懷錶真的藏匿著這隻巨獸的意識……它也很有可能已經極端破碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們腳下的骸骨確實還“沒有死亡”，但它只有最基礎的神經反射。厄爾蘇拉最多只能誘導這些基本反應的走向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只要注意那些——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找掩護！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，只要躲開能砸人的神經束，小心突然刺出的骨矛，沒什麼別的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙畢竟已經被剝得只剩這一具骨架子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但還有你們呢，厄爾蘇拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們可比這半死不活的巨獸危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於忙完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們不來打擾的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這女人就是這裡的指揮官？她對自己手下這具骨架子可夠狠的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些箭，都釘進骨頭裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我幫你們取出來嗎？我倒是有個方便的辦法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳——那瘋子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的面前，還想殺我的部下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，你也太不把我放在眼裡了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是比以前生疏了，厄爾蘇拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你在疤痕商場的日子相當不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們確實是活命的專家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還在卡茲戴爾的時候，經常和老傢伙們私下打賭，賭你們參與的那些任務能有幾個人領到最後的報酬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要押赫德雷，伊內絲，後來還要加個瘋子W，我就總能贏錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，你欠我們一大筆分成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確實牙尖嘴利，“這一位W”，你沒從伊內絲那學點好的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這次你們打錯主意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位王庭之主在這裡全力搏殺，還有，“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡絕不再是總能逃出戰爭的你們，能夠活下來的地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯在倫蒂尼姆的最終手段，你是不是早就有所耳聞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使……那些東西帶來的後果可能遠超常識？你仍舊覺得，在這樣的代價之上重建卡茲戴爾，對薩卡茲是有益的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不用廢話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵們，趁還有時間，把他們了結在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"少校，你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的骨頭上……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是血魔大君閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來他已經準備好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這麼多的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄爾蘇拉，這些血，是從哪裡來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這還用說，是他們那位殺人成癮的血魔大君，把這裡屠了個乾淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他們的手腕……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我將我的血奉獻給您，鮮血王庭的主人。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“願您的獵殺無往不利。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“而我們的血，將為您架起，奔騰的車輿。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄爾蘇拉！停下！你瘋了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這隻巨獸……它正準備游動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在的位置，會被那些歷史的亂流捲走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這女人想和我們同歸於盡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有在操縱它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鮮血取代了肌肉，取代了韌帶，取代了骨髓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們還不夠操縱它的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好伙計們，你們是陪我到最後的人了，我們會在眾魂間相會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，這具骸骨，不再是想要逃開的人，能夠活下來的地方了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快點！我們得先躲到艙室裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幻境已經開始浮現，我們不知道它會前往哪裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——它掀起了浪！注意！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，那血魔要把我們帶去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在這裡。還有她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失血過多，能不能活下來看她本事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們大可把我留在艙室外，赫德雷，我寧願和我的部下們死在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們幹掉的“老相識”這麼多，不會今天突然就發了善心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，這具骸骨已經脫離了我的掌控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也說了，你忠於軍事委員會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你認為軍事委員會，會是卡茲戴爾作為一個“國家”的依仗……那為什麼，那個人還以攝政王自稱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼他還需要特蕾西婭？為什麼他會覺得，打贏這場仗，卡茲戴爾就能有未來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯到底在想什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，這些，等我們拿下這隻巨獸後再談吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們……要去做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的目的從未改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……呵。“回家”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這本來就是這具骸骨最後的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它有一個名字，它的代號是“生命脊椎”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然很少被使用，但是曼弗雷德將軍定下這個名字的時候……也和我說過和你一樣的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一樣的話？曼弗雷德他……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們是敵人，我不會回答更多問題，我只等待我的死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再說，呵，你活到今天本身就是一種答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真當曼弗雷德將軍是個睜眼瞎子？一點都沒看出你們的小伎倆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，那也得等你們從血魔大君的手下活著離開後，才有資格繼續談論“回家”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說的沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借你的懷錶一用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它確實……比我想像的吵鬧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這片大地上遊蕩的巨獸，您還沒死，您自己選擇了換一種方式繼續存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您仍在這裡，對嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下，巨獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你即將涉足卡茲戴爾，我們的城市。那裡的人們拒絕你的到訪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另擇他路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則，薩卡茲將屠戮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們最後的警告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的兄長命令我們禁絕它的前進，遵從魔王的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鮮血王庭，向我奉獻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g3_giantmonsterspinetop"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起那些幻覺般的過往和記憶，你確實給我帶來了一片……更有價值的景色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二位，面對如此景色，你們為何不先散去手中那些弱小又可笑的法術呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看吧，看看周圍，不妨花點時間欣賞一下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……我為你們選定的墳場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明剛剛還是白天，可這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑夜，還有一望無際的海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……星辰變幻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從未在任何典籍或傳說裡，聽聞過這樣的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，這裡只能是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足夠遙遠的遙遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，不知道我們離卡茲戴爾，已有多遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片被所有人喚為泰拉的土地，到底是太過寬闊，還是太過渺小呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的血……在升華。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他藉方才的巫術，喚醒了自己的血脈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說得像局外人一樣，女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明知道，我總是等同地對待純淨之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許，與耗費無數時光尋求淨化的鮮血王庭相比，你還是被源石影響得太深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是罷了，在薩卡茲之中，你也確實還算得上清澈，算得上……強大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，別吝嗇我的祝福，你無法拒絕我的禮物。憑藉被我喚起的力量，你終於配得上與我抗衡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我聽聽如今喪鐘的尖嘯，是否還能令月色晦暗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我書寫，則為我命令。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“黑夜為我遮過死亡。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……又是咒文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是你這些淺薄的咒文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你天賦異稟，這沒錯。你僅靠唇口念誦，靠骨筆書寫，就足以睥睨庸人們可憐的源石“技藝”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，你對傳承就如此牴觸嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向我展示你自己，王庭的主人，女妖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向我——血魔大君杜卡雷，一切鮮血的主宰者，展示你自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下，血魔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos先生，堅持住——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，“魔王”。我都忘了你還在這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯，“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧你，你甚至沒得到我的哪怕一絲恩榮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯的血，冗贅，普通，就算我已經千方百計地打撈，也尋不到一點點才幹與力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至不願說你的血是污濁或駁雜，這些形容詞所包含的，仍是重回純然的期許。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誠然有混亂的血脈令我贊同，但他們無疑，都“強大”，都“壯美”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又有什麼？可笑的動機？淺薄的信仰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不需要回答你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只需要打敗你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是“魔王”？不過是竊取些微旁人的造詣，雜亂，無序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不如那位女妖出於叛逆的心理自創的小玩意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——更不如那對兄妹分毫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要被他挑釁。此時此刻，他的力量仍在增長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"速戰速決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要重新回到晴空之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾殺死過一位所謂的“魔王”，並不困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這次，你的下場也會一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以漆黑的刀斧質疑我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我則以死亡贈你作為回應。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
